      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "An early break proved costly for IDEOLOGY (13) in his Vicbred heat but he had put together a hat trick of wins in SA prior and his overall record stands at six from nine. Tough barrier but he has the talent to win if he gets it right. AFRICAN GALA (7) recorded a strong performance last start when he chased along the sprint lane to just miss out by a head at Kilmore. Draws a couple of spots wider but can go close. OMNIA (12) scored first-up then did a good job when she overcame a break to finish second, beaten 1.2 metres at the latest appearance at Globe Derby. Draws out on the second line so may need luck at some point but her SA form could measure up. MUSCLE VALLEY (8) won his lone second-up attempt so look for improvement.",
